WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.562
International Comparison.

00:00:02.512 --> 00:00:05.737
Canada is not operating in a vacuum.

00:00:05.737 --> 00:00:11.000
Other nations grappled with the same questions and arrived at different conclusions.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.925
Countries like the Netherlands, Belgium, and Switzerland have assisted dying programs — but none match Canada's scale or breadth of eligibility.

00:00:19.925 --> 00:00:23.012
The comparison is instructive and damning.
